- Initial map is the ship interior before discovering they are in a planetary
    graveyard — the Star-eaters' collection of conquered civilizations
- Hundreds of planets in lore; 3–5 actively explored in Album 3
- Tone: acclimating, building alliances or enemies, deepening lore, growing
